@startuml
' Figure 27.6  Two workers, one itinerary (sequence)
' Reading order: top to bottom. June 16, staging: both workers carry
' the lead's token and the token-only check applies two rebookings.
' The fix: each worker takes the stick in its own name and the gateway
' checks the caller; the second waits, re-reads, and stands down.
' From topology.lock.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "Worker 1" as A <<model>>
participant "Worker 2" as B <<model>>
participant "Gateway" as G <<policy>>
== June 16 ==
A -> G : Rebook, lead's token
B -[$FAIL]> G : Rebook, lead's token
G -[$FAIL]-> B : Applied twice
== Fix ==
A -> G : Rebook, own token
B -> B : Wait, re-read
B -> G : Stand down
@enduml
